        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Hoosier Lottery, Multi-State Lottery Association, MUSL\n- Products: Powerball, Hoosier Millionaire\n- Places: United States, District of Columbia, Puerto Rico, U.S. Virgin Islands\n- People: Mark Patrick\n- Topics: Lottery games, television game shows\n\nFacts:\n- The Hoosier Lottery is a member of the Multi-State Lottery Association, also known as MUSL.\n- Powerball is an American lottery game offered by 44 states, the District of Columbia, Puerto Rico, and the U.S. Virgin Islands.\n- Mark Patrick hosted the Hoosier Lottery television game show Hoosier Millionaire for 14 years.",
